      "start_codepoint": 0,
      "end_codepoint": 21,
      "reading": "愍懷太子妃王氏太尉衍女也字惠風貞婉有志節太"
    },
    {
      "pdf_page": 46,
      "half": "左",
      "leaf": "五上",
      "column_from_right": 7,
      "start_codepoint": 21,
      "end_codepoint": 42,
      "reading": "子既廢居于金墉衍請絶婚惠風號哭而歸行路為之"
    },
    {
      "pdf_page": 46,
      "half": "左",
      "leaf": "五上",
      "column_from_right": 8,
      "start_codepoint": 42,
      "end_codepoint": 63,
      "reading": "流涕及劉曜陷洛陽以惠風賜其將喬屬屬將妻之惠"
    },
    {
      "pdf_page": 46,
      "half": "左",
      "leaf": "五上",
      "column_from_right": 9,
      "start_codepoint": 63,
      "end_codepoint": 84,
      "reading": "風拔劍距屬曰吾太尉公女皇太子妃義不為逆胡所"
    },
    {
      "pdf_page": 46,
      "half": "左",
      "leaf": "五上",
      "column_from_right": 10,
      "start_codepoint": 84,
      "end_codepoint": 89,
      "reading": "辱屬遂害之"
    }
  ],
